    "20Hz integer combat; fractional original parameters retain x100 through table/provider, with final integer HP and percentage bridge rounding.",
    "Ordinary vision is radial team sight with strict Roshan boundaries; terrain image is lit and no complete tree/high-ground LOS is claimed.",
    "Consecrated Wraps follows the available damage bridges: self-source and mode4 HP loss/deferred damage cannot spend charges; mode3/5 magic auras remain ordinary magical damage. The simplified combat engine has no separate native Source damage-flag mask, so no stronger HPLOSS-aura equivalence is claimed.",
    "Fixed64 special-event pool. Promised deferred damage and mana refunds cannot be evicted by other effects. If every slot holds protected work, a new deferral is paid as immediate damage and a new Spellslinger refund is paid immediately; existing promises and total resources are conserved. This bounded saturation timing is an explicit H1 adaptation.",
